  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In an April 24, 2024 reported statement, Preston Werntz said, “We want to adopt this. We want to embrace this.” On the same date, he said, “bias-free data might be a place we don’t get to.” In a November 16, 2021 reported statement, he characterized AI and ML as “like fancy kitchen appliances—everyone wants the newest and the one with the most features and buttons.”",
